      "body": "Soft Computing midterm will cover: Fuzzy Sets and Logic (Chapters 1-3), Neural Networks basics (Chapter 4), and Genetic Algorithms introduction (Chapter 5). Exam date will be announced by the department. Refer to the course slides shared on Google Classroom. — Prof. Dr. Faisal Muhammad Shah",
